      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b7efd0f2929584072ccb6ff|full_name}:\nI know it is implemented as a startup variable.\nBut then the frame rate stays low until reboot and it doesn't work in VR mode.\nAlso, the avatar / world behavior may change between high frame rate and low frame rate. It is important to reduce the frame rate only when you leave the window.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
